{"description":"Zowi Firmware de fábrica (BASE v2) — firmware de fábrica de Zowi embebido como código Arduino. Los bloques son solo una representación mínima (zowiHome + zowiMouth). Para flashear el robot usa el código embebido en la pestaña de código.","userTags":[],"hardwareTags":["zowi","Arduino UNO"],"compiled":false,"imageType":"","videoUrl":"","defaultTheme":"infotab_option_colorTheme","software":{"vars":{"name":"varsBloq","content":[[]],"enable":true,"childs":[]},"setup":{"name":"setupBloq","content":[[]],"enable":true,"childs":[{"name":"zowiHome","content":[[]],"enable":true}]},"loop":{"name":"loopBloq","content":[[]],"enable":true,"childs":[{"name":"zowiMouth","content":[[{"alias":"staticDropdown","id":"GESTURE","value":"smile_code"}]],"enable":true}]}},"hardware":{"components":[],"connections":[],"board":"Arduino UNO","robot":"zowi"},"code":"/***   Included libraries  ***/\n#include <BitbloqZowi.h>\n#include <BitbloqUS.h>\n#include <BitbloqBatteryReader.h>\n#include <BitbloqLedMatrix.h>\n#include <Servo.h>\n#include <BitbloqOscillator.h>\n#include <EEPROM.h>\n\n\n\n\n/***   Global variables and function definition  ***/\nZowi zowi;\n\n\n\n\n/***   Setup  ***/void setup(){\nzowi.init();\n\nzowi.home();\n}\n\n\n/***   Loop  ***/void loop(){zowi.putMouth(smile_code, false);\n}\n\n\n\n\n","exportedFromBitbloqOffline":true,"bitbloqOfflineVersion":"1.4.2","bloqsVersion":"tocalvo/bloqs"}